{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0143_1000_p", "source_sha256": "e10e8e5bb6e2063fa6d87578c1c480cb0623be0a76946611aaa75e9035b8678e", "ja": "（取材で歩とダンスパーティーに出席した。慣れない\n社交場で、歩も気後れしているみたいだったけど……）", "zh": "（为了实地考察，我和步出席了舞会。\n来到不熟悉的社交场合，步似乎有些畏缩，不过……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0143_1001_034ayu", "source_sha256": "d86c9156f6e100be0fa14fbc4d4db5aebdbca44a311b421287f441536e27f644", "ja": "つ、疲れた……。それに取材とはいえ、あんな\nオシャレな場所で踊るなんて、緊張したよ～！", "zh": "好、好累啊……而且虽说是为了实地考察，\n在这么时髦的地方跳舞还是好紧张喔～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0143_1002_p", "source_sha256": "36eba99c898a47df0782893248e597e13c1d23d39d861fc2bc2596151e8fe515", "ja": "お疲れさま、歩。緊張したって言う割に、\n結構そつなく踊れてた気がするけど……。", "zh": "辛苦了，步。\n你嘴上说很紧张，但我觉得跳得很流畅耶……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0143_1003_034ayu", "source_sha256": "2584adf28f7ab157532a914768456571ce8bea59413acc97c132bf10daeb862a", "ja": "へへ、まーね！　さすがに、こんな本格的な\nパーティーに出るのは初めてだけど……。", "zh": "嘿嘿，还可以啦！\n虽然这是我第一次参加这种正式的舞会……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0143_1004_034ayu", "source_sha256": "fce1139c39390d7fef50d67fdddd7bd3b3a330ff9abee4d5af47cd339fb7168f", "ja": "アメリカでは、ボールルームダンスって言うんだ。\nで、今日みたいなドレスを着て……。", "zh": "不过在美国，这种社交舞叫做Ballroom Dance，\n要穿今天这样的礼服……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0143_1005_034ayu", "source_sha256": "a7ffeb13f63232d177014184d2ba7df6d0e34a371e8081a9035eb695961e84fd", "ja": "って、なんか思い出したら恥ずかしくなってきた～！\n{$P$}、アタシ変じゃなかった？", "zh": "呃，回想起来觉得好羞耻～！\n{$P$}，我刚才是不是很奇怪？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0143_1006_p", "source_sha256": "16a53dd3aa144f883e0aa0874a014548f64ca9fa2541d3b1574064001ea4f3dd", "ja": "どこも変じゃなかったよ。むしろ、歩には大人びた\nドレスも似合うんだなって、再発見したくらいだ。", "zh": "一点也不奇怪，反而还让我重新发现，\n你很适合成熟的礼服呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0143_1007_034ayu", "source_sha256": "d6292b2f0555c356b2360dfd1b1d295e699500096d1a2fa8d8201edd060f4957", "ja": "えっ、そ、そうかな？\nドレス、似合ってたかな……？", "zh": "咦，是、是吗？\n我适合穿礼服吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0143_1008_p", "source_sha256": "d72db64a421ef6759580ddf5280daade5ab7f3937468989626d4d553e6385a58", "ja": "うん、似合ってた。今度は、そういう仕事に\nチャレンジしてみてもいいんじゃないかな。", "zh": "嗯，很适合。\n下次应该可以挑战看看穿这种衣服的工作吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0143_1009_034ayu", "source_sha256": "a906d7993142fa78870671c23e7da33bdde9b7fa5ec9d04bb6aa40d391e085f7", "ja": "ま、まぁね！　アタシ、洋服とか好きだし、\nドレスくらい着こなせないとね！　あは、あははは！", "zh": "也、也是啦！而且我喜欢洋装，\n区区礼服无法驾驭怎么行呢！啊哈、啊哈哈哈！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0143_1010_p", "source_sha256": "7e550f1cb5b25d9790f2cdb43654a461d713940fcfc56e9652867e12691bfe69", "ja": "そうか、頼もしいな。\nドレスを着る仕事……モデルとかかな？", "zh": "这样啊，真是可靠。\n穿礼服的工作……例如模特儿之类的吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0143_1011_034ayu", "source_sha256": "f79f45a7291996e9de9f664b027a244c50d36cab82a9bc7231300e13af99f53f", "ja": "まかせてよ、{$P$}！　アタシが、\nどんな衣装でも着こなしてみせる！　な、なーんて。", "zh": "交给我吧，{$P$}！不管怎样的服装，\n我都会驾驭给你看！开、开玩笑的啦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0143_1012_p", "source_sha256": "2d0a5bdb861b5728e1f1e374b9a3ce8ebea48904d0eba2ee4fd27b5718b3bf2e", "ja": "そうだな。ドレス姿も可愛かったし、\n合宿の時のパジャマ姿も、よく似合ってたよ。", "zh": "是啊，你穿礼服很可爱，\n集训时穿睡衣的样子也非常适合你喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0143_1013_034ayu", "source_sha256": "af637a92d68f2d2970143deb16dca2d08c90c9bdb85ec06f805c5dc1ae83a281", "ja": "うわあっ！　パジャマのコトは忘れてってば～！\nあれはたまたま、寝ぼけただけで……。", "zh": "唔哇！忘掉睡衣的事情啦～！\n那只是我刚好睡迷糊了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0143_1014_034ayu", "source_sha256": "5a6c39951f8ffbf54ef3e813f19ab39a9f1b079f6629e65529646d1e0c5a741b", "ja": "それに、パジャマは衣装じゃないから！\nうう、恥ずかしい……。", "zh": "而且睡衣又不是表演服装！\n呜呜，好羞耻……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0143_1015_p", "source_sha256": "0eeac605d2fa2015710c0b4de7ca09f4c16bd7b300f3129083c52b8df66dc1b6", "ja": "はは、ごめん。……って、もうこんな時間か。\nそろそろ帰らないとな、明日も早いし。", "zh": "哈哈，抱歉……啊，已经这么晚了吗？\n差不多该回去了，明天还要早起。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0143_1016_034ayu", "source_sha256": "047c0030d3a343412cb660c7cc7d5b5d88dd023ba7c503db0173f7fef52e11c6", "ja": "あっ、そうだね。早く寝ないと、\nアタシも寝坊しちゃいそう……。", "zh": "啊，对耶，不早点睡的话，\n我可能也会睡过头……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0143_1017_034ayu", "source_sha256": "913938e1769af88bf3eae90e86d7b99a11cdd7f0288eedfda9f1151ca405f6b8", "ja": "ねえ、{$P$}。仕事だけど、\n今日のパーティー……なんか楽しかったよね。", "zh": "欸欸，{$P$}，虽然是工作，\n但今天的舞会……挺好玩的呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0143_1018_034ayu", "source_sha256": "ef7b48301b8978f8b55fe44fb424b29b488881e7df3aaf5e99b8bacce0083769", "ja": "また、こんな楽しい仕事ができるかな？", "zh": "之后还会接到这种有趣的工作吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0143_1019_p", "source_sha256": "23ffba962f03d65c216cfa2da13c4cf409a7e578f10caf98e117b7bd2d6bba9f", "ja": "もちろん。\n歩には次の仕事も、楽しんでもらわないとな。", "zh": "当然啰，\n下一份工作也得让你乐在其中才行。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0143_1020_034ayu", "source_sha256": "abe4c897d3232819a22f9ed294b5a49e45314a0555631254f6139e44f1c19bd5", "ja": "へへ、そっか！　今日はいい夢見れそうだな～。\nそれじゃ{$P$}、おやすみ！", "zh": "嘿嘿，这样啊！今天感觉可以做好梦了～\n那么，{$P$}，晚安！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
